{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Guac &amp; Load</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Guac &amp; Load</i> is a fast-paced restaurant sim where chaos in the kitchen turns into a fight for survival.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 Start Your Shift</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook rice, beans, and meats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make some guac and stock your trays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build burrito bowls for customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the register and keep the line moving</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras/18861eda6beadaaef662050825e40006.avif?t=1768490040\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udddf But Watch Out...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers can get aggressive, must be\u00a0the Z-Coli\u00a0outbreak!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab kitchen tools or the guac gun to fight back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive furious ex-customers and keep the restaurant alive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras/195f2d558ec14434cc358e75dc4c7387.avif?t=1768490040\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 Gameplay Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each shift starts calm\u2014just another day behind the counter. But after a while, everything changes. The pressure builds. The music shifts. The customers? Not so friendly anymore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying, cooking, chopping different types of food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preparing customer's orders. A customer has a specific order that you must fulfill, you get money based on how accurate your order is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies (infected by Z-Coli) will come and you'll need to fight to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras/9599cd741a815c75a31bf2101f97f89c.avif?t=1768490040\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras_big/9599cd741a815c75a31bf2101f97f89c.webp?t=1768490040 width=1560 height=853 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Go Deaf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3800880/aa61cf8fdcc6dd50773b29d7ae9e8608d3ada0c1.jpg"},{"name":"Triple Z-Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3800880/0ec09f513bf04cf044ba7cd35f1c1447b14943ef.jpg"},{"name":"Wash your Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3800880/b7630607f68ed355423c357db8245617269c222b.jpg"},{"name":"42 Z-Kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3800880/7d6a390ce271e51d54073e73c5deda489c840ec2.jpg"},{"name":"100% Perfect Orders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3800880/0ca63f43289f8d984b2ce953861901a99d32b938.jpg"},{"name":"Survive 5 Waves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3800880/aafd19737b0b9f3ef0d7f2043f6f06cc61357e13.jpg"},{"name":"Cheater!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3800880/b43638a19a1bee599cb39877b12487981d731e47.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800880?t=1768490040","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/0b661c4cba67c907834d9f4f117ef3a4a59f205a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t